{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15103","headline":"闻亡友王七嘉禾寺得素琴 · 李益","name":"闻亡友王七嘉禾寺得素琴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人惜此去，留琴明月前。\n今来我访旧，泪洒白云天。\n讵欲匣孤响，送君归夜泉。\n抚琴犹可绝，况此故无弦。\n何必雍门奏，然後泪潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}